" end="1:32.717" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.525" end="1:31.898">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:31.898" end="1:32.717">no</span></p><p begin="1:33.159" end="1:38.093" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.159" end="1:33.525">一</span><span begin="1:33.525" end="1:33.760">次</span><span begin="1:33.760" end="1:34.410">又</span><span begin="1:34.410" end="1:34.611">一</span><span begin="1:34.611" end="1:35.159">次</span><span begin="1:35.159" end="1:35.394">只</span><span begin="1:35.394" end="1:35.960">会</span><span begin="1:35.960" end="1:36.247">用</span><span begin="1:36.247" end="1:36.679">藉</span><span begin="1:36.679" end="1:37.466">口逃</span><span begin="1:37.466" end="1:38.093">避</span></p><p begin="1:38.250" end="1:43.123" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.250" end="1:38.784">怎么你</span><span begin="1:38.784" end="1:39.552">从来</span><span begin="1:39.855" end="1:40.403">没对我</span><span begin="1:40.403" end="1:40.856">彻</span><span begin="1:40.856" end="1:41.956">底地死</span><span begin="1:41.956" end="1:43.123">心</span></p></div><div begin="1:46.254" end="1:56.327" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:46.254" end="1:51.147" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.254" end="1:46.650">我</span><span begin="1:46.650" end="1:46.850">有</span><span begin="1:46.850" end="1:47.419">何</span><span begin="1:47.419" end="1:47.683">德</span><span begin="1:47.683" end="1:48.220">何</span><span begin="1:48.220" end="1:48.501">能</span><span begin="1:48.501" end="1:49.102">值</span><span begin="1:49.102" end="1:49.369">得</span><span begin="1:49.369" end="1:49.921">你珍</span><span begin="1:49.921" end="1:51.147">惜</span></p><p begin="1:51.566" end="1:56.327" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.566" end="1:51.938">为何</span><span begin="1:51.938" end="1:53.087">你</span><span begin="1:53.087" end="1:53.407">对</span><span begin="1:53.407" end="1:53.903">我</span><span begin="1:53.903" end="1:54.554">有求</span><span begin="1:54